ls great  so I'm not worried I'm not upset I'm  just a little bit in the dark about  where this goes I mean we have DOM is a  great character  and she is firmly in the middle of  things that's a good thing Phillip price  is sort of in limbo we know what right  white rose is all about I mean obviously  we want to learn more about what's going  on at Washington Township in the Chinese  Republic of Congo but yeah I'll be  interested to see what you guys think  because I just don't really see where we  go from here as of yet at the end of the  day or the end of the season as it is  here Eliot is at least satisfied that he  was able to undo what he did and I think  it's not lightly hinted at there that  he's not done he still wants to go after  that 1% of the 1% is Dom gonna work for  the dark army she has to right so what  is that gonna look like did ring  actually leave for good is he really on  sabbatical writing his book I hope he  wasn't a one-off character although he  can always come back later sort of like  Fernando Vera did we'll just have to  wait and see I think Leon I hope we see  more of him he's been really he's been a  character that the writing for his  character has been really good hard to  figure out where Darlene will go hard to  figure out where Angela will go so I  guess if you're someone who likes things  to be completely up in the air then you  might be pretty happy make sure you guys  tell me what you think in the comments I  will do another like season 3 video at  some point here where we talk about what  we think might happen speculation all of  that sort of thing but for now that's  the end of season 3 mr. robot it was a  good season I was excited to watch every  episode and I was rarely let down so  gotta love that please like the video if  you enjoyed it please subscribe to my  channel and make sure that you turn on  notifications if you want to see more  videos like this if you have ideas for  shows and things like that you can come  join u